KONOHA HOSPITAL — PATIENT TREATMENT RECORD (SUMMARY)

Facility: Konohagakure General Hospital, Medical Corps.
Records are confidential and released only to the patient, their jonin-sensei, or the Hokage's office.

Representative admissions:
- Rock Lee — extensive skeletal/muscular damage following Chunin Exam preliminary bout; complex reconstructive surgery performed by the Hokage-designate. Long rehabilitation ordered.
- Hyuga, Hinata — chakra-point trauma; monitored recovery.
- Team members returning from C-rank escort (Land of Waves) — treated for exhaustion and laceration; discharged.

Standing notes: All post-mission injuries above minor severity require a Medical Corps entry. Chakra exhaustion cases are held for observation. Blood type and allergy data maintained per shinobi.

Attending: Medical Corps duty roster.
